    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted re delighted to present 103 The Hazel, Grange Hill, Rathfarnham, Dublin 16 to the market a superb two bedroom, two bathroom ground floor apartment presented in excellent condition throughout. Grange Hill is a highly regarded and well-maintained development ideally located close to an abundance of amenities including Nutgrove Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre, both offering a fantastic selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities. \r\n\r\nRathfarnham Village is also within easy reach along with a variety of popular local cafés, eateries and bars. Recreational amenities are plentiful in the area with Marlay Park, St. Enda's Park and a range of sports clubs and gyms all nearby. The location is further enhanced by excellent public transport links, numerous bus routes and easy access to the M50 road network, while a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools are also close by.\r\n\r\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, generous lounge/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms including master ensuite, and main family bathroom. The property has been tastefully maintained and upgraded by its current owners with the ensuite bathroom recently renovated, along with new carpet flooring and fresh repainting throughout, creating a bright and modern living space ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nNo. 103 offers an excellent opportunity for first time buyers, investors or those looking to downsize into a well-located and turnkey home. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n• c. 67 sqm\r\n• BER C2 \r\n• 2 Bed / 2 Bath\r\n• Ground floor apartment \r\n• Parking \r\n• Electric heating\r\n• Double glazed windows\r\n• East facing balcony \r\n• Well maintained communal gardens \r\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout \r\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\r\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance \r\n• Highly sought after location \r\n• No onwards chain \r\n• Ideal for a wide range of buyers \r\n• Viewing highly advised!\r\n\r\nDirections;\r\nEircode: D16 W983"
      },
      {
